# Immortals switching, forcing, configuring and shutting down. In the temple (3001), with Hassan: Smokegod (60),
# Seraph (56), Cherub (52) and Decimus (10). Seraph switches into Hassan, talks as him, and sees mwhere's "in the body
# of"; stat of a player from a mob's body shows Practices 0 (#68). Purging a mob someone is switched into sends them
# home first. force refuses delete and mob commands and those of the same trust or above; act reads the $ codes in a
# forced command (#71); force all, players and gods reach those below. A switched immortal can't qmconfig or set
# security, and a mob with no connection can't switch or return. Seraph can't force all, players or gods (56: below 57
# and 58), and can't snoop, switch into or force someone in room 1205, private for implementors. An immortal under
# noemote can't smote. qmconfig shows, toggles and reads the settings. Last, Smokegod goes wizinvis and shuts the game
# down: no echo, and shutdown.txt says who.
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
wiznet
wiznet switches
@connect ser
Seraph
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
